       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-WEYL-CLOSURE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-WEYL-CLOSURE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-WEYL-ROOT-REFLECTION-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COXETER-ORBIT-BIJECT     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CARTAN-ALGEBRA-ISOMORPH  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WEYL-CHAMBER-CONVEX-HULL PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GFM-WEYL-SOVEREIGN-SEAL  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-WEYL-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-WEYL-PROVEN          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-WEYL-CODE          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-ROOTS-AND-COXETER.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-CARTAN-AND-CHAMBER.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-WEYL-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-ROOTS-AND-COXETER.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WEYL-ROOT-REFLECTION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COXETER-ORBIT-BIJECT.
       2000-EVALUATE-CARTAN-AND-CHAMBER.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CARTAN-ALGEBRA-ISOMORPH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WEYL-CHAMBER-CONVEX-HULL.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-WEYL-PROOFS.
           IF WS-WEYL-ROOT-REFLECTION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-COXETER-ORBIT-BIJECT = 1 AND
              WS-CARTAN-ALGEBRA-ISOMORPH = 1 AND
              WS-WEYL-CHAMBER-CONVEX-HULL = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-GFM-WEYL-SOVEREIGN-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-WEYL-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-WEYL-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-WEYL-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-WEYL-CODE.
